WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.640
Here's the healthcare paradox Washington still cannot explain.

2
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:16.560
Puerto Rico receives 41% less Medicare funding than the states, and yet it delivers some

3
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:22.000
of the strongest Medicare Advantage quality results in the nation.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.100
How is that possible?

5
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:29.320
And imagine what Puerto Rico could accomplish if Washington funded it fairly.

6
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:33.000
That is exactly what The Healthcare Paradox explores.

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.080
Real data and real federal policy, explained in plain English.

8
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.880
No jargon, no spin.

9
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.960
Less funding, exceptional performance.

10
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:48.200
So ask the question Washington still has not answered.

11
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:51.880
Why is Puerto Rico funded differently?

12
00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.880
The Healthcare Paradox.

